{"id":17977,"name":"Russell County","slug":"russell-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/russell-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Highest Bidder","redemptionPeriod":"3 years","interestRate":"8%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"May"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Revenue Commissioner"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Russell County Courthouse"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Russell County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"oUrda9CqGNQ8Km3neISiLHs5PJMD1pB4YZbWchjVg2TA7tXfxkzRF\"><iframe title=\"An 8% Interest Opportunity - Russell County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cCjOJ4mCW90?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span> \n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"An-8%-Interest-Opportunity---Russell-County---Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">An 8% Interest Opportunity &#8211; Russell County &#8211; Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Imagine a land sale with a twist. Welcome to Russell County, Alabama&#8217;s Tax Land Sale—an exciting investment opportunity!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You&#8217;re not just buying land; you&#8217;re bidding on tax liens with the chance to earn a solid 8% interest. This event takes place at the county courthouse, offering a pathway to property ownership if the lien is unredeemed.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What Are Tax Lien Certificates?</strong> Tax lien certificates are issued when property owners fail to pay their property taxes. By purchasing these certificates, investors pay the owed taxes and, in return, get the right to collect back taxes with interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Do They Work?</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Example</strong>: You buy a tax lien certificate on a property. The property owner then has a set period, typically three years, to repay the back taxes plus interest. If they do not, you can foreclose on the property.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Returns</strong>: Typically, you earn 8% interest on your investment if the lien is redeemed within the redemption period.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing in Russell County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong><br><br>Knowing the legal framework is crucial. Key regulations include redemption periods and bidding procedures.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong><br><br><a href=\"https://russell.capturecama.com/custom/CA_Welcome.aspx#down\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Russell County Tax Lien Information</mark></a><br><br><a href=\"https://rcala.com/revenue-commissioner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Russell County Revenue Commissioner</mark></a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br><br>Auctions are held at the Russell County Courthouse. More details can be found on <a href=\"https://www.bid4assets.com/auction/index/1088642\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bid4Assets</mark></a>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Read the Details About Tax Liens</strong><br><br>It&#8217;s essential to understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiries, and other important details.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br><br>For additional inquiries, reach out to the Revenue Commissioner at PO Box 669, Phenix City, AL 36868, or call 334-298-6922.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Russell-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17980 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Russell County Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework</strong>: Check for any existing liens on the property before you bid.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Sign Up Early</strong>: You need to sign up for the auction in May by the end of April.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Follow-up</strong>: Monitor the redemption period closely to see if you need to take further action.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-bl